 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！在学校里，我们每天都在学习。今天，就来学和学习有关的单词。"
    },
    {
     "en": "learn"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:learn",
    "focus:learn"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "学新的东西，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "learn"
    },
    {
     "en": "I learn English."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:read",
    "edge:learn>read",
    "focus:read"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "学习的第一步，是读："
    },
    {
     "en": "read"
    },
    {
     "en": "Let's read together."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:story",
    "edge:read>story",
    "focus:story"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "读什么呢？读有趣的故事："
    },
    {
     "en": "story"
    },
    {
     "zh": "很多故事，要把 y 变成 i e s：",
     "cue": [
      "plural:story"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "stories"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:write",
    "edge:learn>write",
    "focus:write"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "学了还要会写："
    },
    {
     "en": "write"
    },
    {
     "zh": "开头的 w 不发音哦。"
    },
    {
     "en": "I write well."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:spell",
    "edge:write>spell",
    "focus:spell"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "把一个单词的字母，一个一个说出来，是拼写："
    },
    {
     "en": "spell"
    },
    {
     "en": "C, A, T, cat."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:spelling",
    "edge:spell>spelling",
    "focus:spelling"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "加上 i n g，就是拼写这件事，比如拼写测验："
    },
    {
     "en": "spelling"
    },
    {
     "en": "a spelling test"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:understand",
    "edge:learn>understand",
    "focus:understand"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "学会了，心里亮堂堂的，是明白、理解："
    },
    {
     "en": "understand"
    },
    {
     "zh": "在下面，加上站："
    },
    {
     "en": "under"
    },
    {
     "en": "stand"
    },
    {
     "en": "understand"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:repeat",
    "edge:understand>repeat",
    "focus:repeat"
   ],
   "parts": [
